On his way back home, Kezuru is attacked by an airship-like creature. Just when he thinks, \"this is it!\" to himself, his Mazica Gear erupts and a magic book appears. When he scratches a card, he seals a contract with Barunya, a \"mazin\" creature that is an odd remixed fusion between an airship and a cat.\n\nThe mysterious girl Anya says Kezuru and those of his ilk will be \"the true wizards who save the world.\" Amid all these mysterious revelations, Kezuru enrolls in the Mazica Academy and engages in Mazica Party card battles alongside his partner mazin."},"tags":[{"name":"Kids","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Proxy Battle","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Card Battle","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":26,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"MAZICA PARTY","english":null,"native":"MAZICA PARTY","romaji":"MAZICA PARTY","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"マジカパーティ"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"魔卡派对"}]},"trailer":{"id":"L3pEIA8c9e4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L3pEIA8c9e4/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}